Collagen is the magic ingredient here. This protein is naturally found in your skin, but production slows down as we age. That's where the Daiso Deep C Collagen Moisture Gel Cream 40g comes in. It boasts a double dose of collagen, helping to replenish what your skin is losing. This translates to increased elasticity, reduced wrinkles, and a youthful bounce.

But Collagen isn't the only star of the show. This moisturizer is also free of alcohol, artificial colors, and fragrances, making it ideal for even the most sensitive skin types. Plus, its lightweight formula absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue behind.

&nbsp;

<b><u>How to Use:</u></b>

Simply cleanse your face and pat it dry. Then, take a pea-sized amount of the cream and massage it gently into your skin, focusing on areas that tend to be dry. Apply morning and night for optimal results.

